RIFLE class in patients with acute kidney injury</article-title><source>Nephrol Dial Transplant</source><year>2009</year><volume>24</volume><fpage>2739</fpage><lpage>2744</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1093/ndt/gfp159</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">19349297</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B10"><mixed-citation publication-type="other"><article-title>Graphpad Software</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.graphpad.com">http://www.graphpad.com</ext-link></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B11"><mixed-citation publication-type="other"><article-title>ROC analysis: web-based calculator for ROC curves</article-title><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://www.jrocfit.org">http://www.jrocfit.org</ext-link></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B12"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Chasis</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Smith</surname><given-names>HW</given-names></name><article-title>The excretion of urea in normal man and in subjects with glomerulonephritis</article-title><source>J Clin Invest</source><year>1938</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>347</fpage><lpage>358</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1172/JCI100959</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16694579</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B13"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Gamble</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name><article-title>Physiological information gained from studies of the life raft ration</article-title><source>Harvey Lect</source><year>1946</year><volume>42</volume><fpage>247</fpage><lpage>278</lpage></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="B14"><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><name><surname>Chesley</surname><given-names>LC</given-names></name><article-title>Renal excretion at low urine volumes and the mechanism of oliguria</article-title><source>J Clin Invest</source><year>1938</year><volume>17</volume><fpage>591</fpage><lpage>597</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.11